\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  God gives you not anything
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and He gives to your neighbour,
\par don't let sadness fill your soul
\par and let no pain feels your heart.
\par Put thy trust in Christ the Lord.
\par He will never forsake you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  This earth and all the good things
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 are not perfect for mankind
\par Those who are living on earth
\par are to us only strangers
\par God rule over His kingdom
\par and does whatever he wish.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  It is not those earthly things
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 that will make you live on earth
\par Look up into the heavens
\par there your treasure is laid up
\par honour without any hate
\par happiness shall ever be.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Can a handful of garbage
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 makes you feel so sorrowful?
\par Look, it is the Lord who give
\par to the faithful all good things.
\par If you have good things from Lord,
\par \pard     leave out the thugs of this world.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

